-- Spinal 30%: (c)(ii) is "less than 30"; (c)(i): 26 530 + 20 x 3980 = 106 130.
#ASSERT `How much is my impairment benefit for a physical impairment` 30 `a spinal impairment (s 210(2)(a)(iii), or a spinal impairment otherwise)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST 106130
-- (d) 31%: 106 130 + 6640 = 112 770; 70%: 106 130 + 40 x 6640 = 371 730.
#ASSERT `How much is my impairment benefit for a physical impairment` 31 `any other whole person impairment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST 112770
#ASSERT `How much is my impairment benefit for a physical impairment` 70 `any other whole person impairment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST 371730
