#ASSERT `How much is my impairment benefit for a physical impairment` 71 `any other whole person impairment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST 410870
#ASSERT `How much is my impairment benefit for a physical impairment` 79 `any other whole person impairment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST 741750
#ASSERT `How much is my impairment benefit for a physical impairment` 80 `any other whole person impairment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST 783000
-- (f) 85%: 783 000.
