§§ `Damages at common law`

-- s 328(2)(b): event 1 March 2025; 18 months later 1 September 2026; first day 2 September 2026. Event 31 August 2025:
-- 18 months later is February 2027, which has no 31st: 28 February 2027; first day 1 March 2027.
#ASSERT `From what day can I apply on the ground of serious injury` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2025) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2026
#ASSERT `From what day can I apply on the ground of serious injury` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2025) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2027

-- s 330(1) with s 329A. Received 1 March 2026: 30 days to 31 March, 30 to 30 April, 31 to 31 May, 29 to 29 June = 120:
-- 29 June 2026. Received 1 November 2026: 29 (November) + 23 (to 23 December) = 52, then from 10 January: 22 = 74,
-- February 28 = 102, 18 March = 120: 18 March 2027. Received 24 December 2025: the count starts on 10 January 2026:
-- 22 (January) + 28 + 31 + 30 = 111, 9 May = 120: 9 May 2026.
