#ASSERT `By what day must my serious injury application be answered` (DATE_FROM_DMY 24 12 2025) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 9 5 2026

-- s 335(1): assessed at 30% before the application: deemed. 29%, received 1 March 2026 (last day 29 June 2026): on
