#ASSERT `Is my injury taken to be a serious injury` 30 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2026) FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2020) (DATE_FROM_DMY 2 3 2026) EQUALS `deemed a serious injury: impairment assessed at 30 per cent or more (s 335(1))`
