#ASSERT `Is my injury taken to be a serious injury` 29 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2026) FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2020) (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2026) EQUALS `deemed a serious injury: no written advice within the time (s 330(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my injury taken to be a serious injury` 29 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2026) TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 29 6 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2026) EQUALS `damages only with the certificate of the Authority or self-insurer, or the leave of a court (s 335(2))`
